{"id":"memorial_102603","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial102600","label":"Call Logs · Jonathan_report"},"label":"day55.mp4","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_102602","next":"memorial_102604","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_102603_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"(File corrupted, audio only)"},{"id":"memorial_102603_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"We saw it. Hope."},{"id":"memorial_102603_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"Or was it merely a mirage?"},{"id":"memorial_102603_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"I can vaguely see something in the distance. Something resembling a man-made structure."},{"id":"memorial_102603_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"I'm positive they're not ruins from before the First Invasion."},{"id":"memorial_102603_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"This structure off in the distance seems to have been built using technology far beyond what humans are currently capable of."},{"id":"memorial_102603_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"I am certain of this, for I saw there are lights on the structure."},{"id":"memorial_102603_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"I also saw the shadow of a flying angel, or perhaps it was a Nikke?"},{"id":"memorial_102603_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_26_03_description","text":"We will go there at daybreak."}]}